  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "No framework, and that is a decision",
      "items": [
        "No CSS framework: inline styles reading var(--cv-*) through one token object",
        "Switching theme restyles everything with zero React re-renders",
        "No store: hooks, props, and localStorage + the storage event across windows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Three transports, strictly divided",
      "items": [
        "WebSocket: live PTY bytes, opened only by Terminal.tsx",
        "invoke(): everything pull-shaped \u2014 transcripts, rosters, diffs, spend",
        "fetch(): never. Zero occurrences in src/, because there is no CORS layer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Why tabs never reconnect",
      "items": [
        "Hidden panes are display:none, never unmounted or reparented",
        "Panes are positioned from CSS variables, so dragging re-renders nothing",
        "doFit() refuses a 0\u00d70 container, so a hidden tab cannot corrupt the PTY size",
        "SessionWindow \u2192 Trace is unlabelled: the endpoints name the relationship"
      ]
    }
  ]
